Whispry
Copyright (C) 2026 cosmictaser

Whispry is an open-source Android app that turns a hold-to-talk trigger
(volume key, floating widget, or on-keyboard button) into an instantly
formatted transcript — dictate anywhere, in any app, without switching
context.

Original repository: https://github.com/cosmictaserdev-creator/whispry

